        "id": "fmm",
        "title": {
          "ja": "2次元対数核のM2M・M2L・L2Lを持つFMM",
          "en": "2D logarithmic FMM with M2M, M2L and L2L"
        },
        "method_ids": [
          "fmm"
        ],
        "summary": {
          "ja": "自由空間の対数ポテンシャルを一様四分木の多重極・局所展開で評価し、直接和と比較します。",
          "en": "Evaluate a free-space log potential with uniform-quadtree multipole and local expansions and compare with direct sums."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "単位正方形内の有限点電荷ですが、境界は壁でなく木を作る包囲領域です。核はphi=−sum(q log r)、電場は−grad(phi)。自己項を除外し、周期像はありません。",
          "en": "Particles lie in a unit-square bounding box, not a physical wall boundary. The kernel is phi=−sum(q log r), with field −grad(phi); self terms are excluded and no periodic images are used."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "葉でP2M、上向きのM2M、相互作用リスト上のM2L、下向きのL2L、局所多項式の評価と近接P2Pを実装します。遠方を粒子ごとに開くBarnes–Hutへ置き換えず、移動演算回数と近接対数を記録します。",
          "en": "Implement leaf P2M, upward M2M, interaction-list M2L, downward L2L, local-polynomial evaluation and near-field P2P. Record translation and near-pair counts; this is not a Barnes–Hut traversal relabeled as FMM."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "固定seedの128粒子で次数2・4・8・12を走査し、別の全対直接和とポテンシャル・電場の全成分を照合します。2点の符号、順序不変性、ポテンシャル微分も検査します。",
          "en": "For 128 fixed-seed particles, sweep orders 2/4/8/12 and compare every potential/field component with a separate all-pairs calculation. Also check two-source signs, permutation invariance and potential derivatives."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "3次元1/r核、適応木、周期FMM、特異積分、実測の計算量スケーリングは未検証です。2次元自由空間の教育用実装として表示します。",
          "en": "No 3D 1/r kernel, adaptive tree, periodic FMM, singular quadrature or empirical complexity/scaling study. Evidence applies to this 2D free-space educational implementation."
        },
        "equations": [
          "M_k(c)=\\sum_jq_j(z_j-c)^k",
          "f(z)=M_0\\log(z-c)-\\sum_{k=1}^p\\frac{M_k}{k(z-c)^k},\\qquad\\phi=-\\Re f"
        ],
        "references": [
          {
            "id": "greengard1987",
            "author": "L. Greengard and V. Rokhlin",
            "year": 1987,
            "title": "A fast algorithm for particle simulations",
            "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(87)90140-9",
            "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/0021-9991(87)90140-9",
            "review_level": "selected-full-text",
            "review_note": {
              "ja": "著者所属機関の再録PDFで対数核、モーメント、3つの移動演算、上下走査を確認。再録版の掲載年1997と原著1987を区別。",
              "en": "Institution-hosted reprint consulted for the log kernel, moments, three translations and up/down passes; 1997 reprint distinguished from 1987 original."
            }
          }
        ],
